Remove a workspace and unmount its overlay

Usage: forkspace drop [OPTIONS] [NAME]

Arguments:
  [NAME]  Name of the workspace to remove

Options:
      --force  Force removal even if the workspace has children
      --kill   Stop processes still running in the workspace
      --all    Remove all workspaces
      --glob   Treat name as a glob pattern to match multiple workspaces
  -h, --help   Print help
